{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfcRJgrA91ADHKUjQjATR", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The barcode matches The Cranberries' \"Zombie\" (option A).\n\nI sampled one frame per second from each of the ten videos and shrank each frame to its average color. Then I stretched each video's color sequence to the barcode's width and measured the average color difference against the barcode, stripe by stripe (on a 0\u2013255 scale, lower is closer).\n\n- **A (Zombie):** 14.6, the clear best match.\n- **The next nine:** between about 30 and 41, starting with F (Heathens) at 30.2 and G (Numb) at 30.6.\n- **J (Sorry):** 156, nowhere close.\n\nZombie's gap of about 15 points to the runner-up is large. Its video's grey footage, with dark reddish-brown and teal scenes, also fits what the barcode looks like.\n\nAnswer: A"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 705, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6446, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 705}, "output_tokens": 268, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "4a59d90b-dbb3-44a1-a7c8-98c199306604", "uuid": "923f4b67-3fef-4eba-a08e-97aca2ca8a19", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T23:55:00.521Z", "request_id": "req_011CfcRJgSqY8CpLhCYdKSoV"}
